    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Bishop A. Edward Pevec The Most Reverend (Anthony) Edward Pevec was born in Cleveland, OH on April 16,1925. He was ordained a Priest on April 29,1950 and ordained a Bishop on July 2,1982. He was installed Vicar of Eastern Region July 20,1982 and retired April 3, 2001. He attended St. Vitus Elementary School and then Cathedral Latin High School. He went on to Sacred Heart Seminary, Detroit, MI and then St. Mary Seminary for his Cleveland Ordination."
    ]
  },
